Package: lider
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: ffmpeg, nodejs | deno
Homepage: @URL@
Description: @SUMMARY@
 LID downloads files over several connections at once with dynamic
 segmentation, and resumes them later. It sorts downloads into categories,
 runs queues on a schedule and limits speed. Paste a YouTube link to choose
 a resolution or audio only; ffmpeg and a JavaScript runtime are used for
 that. PySide6 and yt-dlp are bundled in /usr/lib/lider.
